SYNTHESIS
========================================================================
The additive shadow by itself is too coarse: it is just the total order. The multiplicative shadow is the divisibility DAG sitting inside that transitive completion.  Product-sum equations are therefore best treated as critical pairs in the labeled gate hypergraph, not as ordinary edges.
